                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Once this island flourished with Spell Trees. They were the source of our power, the source of our names. But our reservoir ran dry.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_TreeF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Grandperson_Tree_AH-PRIM_007.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1756055,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC23_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "No, no, don't do this! Not again!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Tree_Ahmarra_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Oliver_AH-PRIM_010.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1756029,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC23_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Where once we drank heavily and without fear, now we are parched, gasping for motes of power. So many hatchlings remain Nameless, without song.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_TreeF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Grandperson_Tree_AH-PRIM_008.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1756055,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC23_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "No, no, no!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Tree_Ahmarra_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Oliver_AH-PRIM_011.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1756029,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
